Description: Reproducible R code for survey-weighted analyses of androgen,
    anti-Mullerian hormone, SHBG, and metabolic traits in NHANES, including
    literature-aligned definition replay, with local-only baseline and
    longitudinal interfaces for restricted-redistribution SWAN public-use files.
